# Twitch Helix (required for real Twitch profile ingest).
# Create an app at https://dev.twitch.tv/console/apps
# Client Credentials flow needs both values. Never commit real secrets.
#
# Local (Vite): copy to `.env` — the vite-plugin-twitch-api reads these.
# Cloudflare Pages: Settings → Variables and Secrets (encrypt the secret).
TWITCH_CLIENT_ID=
TWITCH_CLIENT_SECRET=

# X/Twitter: no API keys required.
# We resolve via public FxTwitter (api.fxtwitter.com) with unavatar.io fallback.
